§ `8. the presumption of corruption`

`p employee and dealer` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the contrary is proved` IS FALSE

`p employee and dealer, contrary proved` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the contrary is proved` IS TRUE

`p employee and dealer agent` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS TRUE
    `the contrary is proved` IS FALSE

`p dealer only` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the contrary is proved` IS FALSE

`p employee only` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the contrary is proved` IS FALSE

`p none` MEANS `Presumption Facts` WITH
    `the gratification was paid or given to, or received by, a person in the employment of the Government or any department of the Government or of a public body` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was paid or given by, or received from, an agent of a person who has or seeks to have any dealing with the Government or any department of the Government or any public body` IS FALSE
