§ `5. punishment for corruption`

`s5 receipt, corruptly, limb i` MEANS `Section 5 Facts` WITH
    `the accused solicited or received, or agreed to receive, a gratification for himself or herself or for any other person` IS TRUE
    `the accused gave, promised or offered a gratification to any person, whether for the benefit of that person or of another person` IS FALSE
    `the accused acted corruptly` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement to, reward for, or on account of, any person doing or forbearing to do anything in respect of any matter or transaction whatsoever, actual or proposed` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement to, reward for, or on account of, a member, officer or servant of a public body doing or forbearing to do anything in respect of any matter or transaction whatsoever, actual or proposed, in which the public body is concerned` IS FALSE

