`s6c gave a false document` MEANS `Section 6 Facts` WITH
    `the agent accepted or obtained, or agreed to accept or attempted to obtain, from any person, a gratification for himself or herself or for any other person` IS FALSE
    `the accused gave, agreed to give or offered a gratification to an agent` IS FALSE
    `the accused acted corruptly` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for doing or forbearing to do, or for having done or forborne to do, an act in relation to the principal's affairs or business, or for showing or forbearing to show favour or disfavour to any person in relation to the principal's affairs or business` IS FALSE
    `the accused knowingly gave an agent a receipt, account or other document` IS TRUE
    `the accused, being an agent, knowingly used with intent to deceive the principal a receipt, account or other document` IS FALSE
    `the principal is interested in the document` IS TRUE
    `the document contains a statement which is false or erroneous or defective in a material particular` IS TRUE
    `the statement is, to the accused's knowledge, intended to mislead the principal` IS TRUE

