§ `9. guilty notwithstanding that the purpose is not carried out`

`s9(1) reason to believe, all four excuses present` MEANS `Section 9 Facts` WITH
    `the agent corruptly accepted, obtained or agreed to accept, or attempted to obtain, a gratification` IS TRUE
    `the accused corruptly gave, agreed to give or offered a gratification to an agent` IS FALSE
    `the accused had reason to believe or suspect that the gratification was offered as an inducement or reward for doing or forbearing to do an act, or for showing or forbearing to show favour or disfavour to a person, in relation to the principal's affairs or business` IS TRUE
    `the accused had reason to believe or suspect that the agent had the power, right or opportunity to do, show or forbear, and that the act, favour or disfavour was in relation to the principal's affairs or business` IS FALSE
    `the agent had the power, right or opportunity to do, show or forbear` IS FALSE
    `the agent accepted the gratification without intending to do, show or forbear` IS FALSE
    `the agent did not in fact do, show or forbear` IS FALSE
    `the act, favour or disfavour was not in relation to the principal's affairs or business` IS FALSE

