§ `10. corruptly procuring withdrawal of tenders`

`s10(a) full` MEANS `Section 10 Facts` WITH
    `the accused offered a gratification to a person who had made a tender for a contract` IS TRUE
    `the accused did so with intent to obtain the contract from the Government or a public body` IS TRUE
    `the contract was for performing work, providing a service, doing anything, or supplying an article, material or substance` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or a reward for the tenderer's withdrawing the tender` IS TRUE
    `the accused solicited or accepted a gratification as an inducement or a reward for withdrawing a tender made by the accused for that contract` IS FALSE

`s10(a) no intent to obtain the contract` MEANS `Section 10 Facts` WITH
    `the accused offered a gratification to a person who had made a tender for a contract` IS TRUE
    `the accused did so with intent to obtain the contract from the Government or a public body` IS FALSE
    `the contract was for performing work, providing a service, doing anything, or supplying an article, material or substance` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or a reward for the tenderer's withdrawing the tender` IS TRUE
    `the accused solicited or accepted a gratification as an inducement or a reward for withdrawing a tender made by the accused for that contract` IS FALSE

