    `the accused offered a gratification to a Member of Parliament` IS TRUE
    `the accused, being a Member of Parliament, solicited or accepted a gratification` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the Member's doing or forbearing to do an act in his or her capacity as a Member` IS FALSE

`s11 Member accepts, not in his capacity` MEANS `Section 11 Facts` WITH
    `the accused offered a gratification to a Member of Parliament` IS FALSE
    `the accused, being a Member of Parliament, solicited or accepted a gratification` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the Member's doing or forbearing to do an act in his or her capacity as a Member` IS FALSE

