§ `12. bribery of a member of a public body: three alternative purposes`

`s12 offer for vote` MEANS `Section 12 Facts` WITH
    `the accused offered a gratification to a member of a public body` IS TRUE
    `the accused, being a member of a public body, solicited or accepted a gratification` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's voting or abstaining from voting at a meeting of the public body in favour of or against a measure, resolution or question submitted to it` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's performing or abstaining from performing, or aid in procuring, expediting, delaying, hindering or preventing the performance of, an official act` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's aid in procuring or preventing the passing of a vote or the granting of a contract or advantage in favour of any person` IS FALSE

`s12 member accepts for vote` MEANS `Section 12 Facts` WITH
    `the accused offered a gratification to a member of a public body` IS FALSE
    `the accused, being a member of a public body, solicited or accepted a gratification` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's voting or abstaining from voting at a meeting of the public body in favour of or against a measure, resolution or question submitted to it` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's performing or abstaining from performing, or aid in procuring, expediting, delaying, hindering or preventing the performance of, an official act` IS FALSE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's aid in procuring or preventing the passing of a vote or the granting of a contract or advantage in favour of any person` IS FALSE

