    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's performing or abstaining from performing, or aid in procuring, expediting, delaying, hindering or preventing the performance of, an official act` IS TRUE
    `the gratification was an inducement or reward for the member's aid in procuring or preventing the passing of a vote or the granting of a contract or advantage in favour of any person` IS FALSE

