§ `5, 6, 7 and the others. Punishment`

`no contract` MEANS `Government Contract Facts` WITH
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with the Government or any department of the Government` IS FALSE
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with a public body` IS FALSE
    `the matter or transaction was a subcontract to execute work comprised in such a contract` IS FALSE

`Government contract` MEANS `Government Contract Facts` WITH
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with the Government or any department of the Government` IS TRUE
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with a public body` IS FALSE
    `the matter or transaction was a subcontract to execute work comprised in such a contract` IS FALSE

`public body contract` MEANS `Government Contract Facts` WITH
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with the Government or any department of the Government` IS FALSE
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with a public body` IS TRUE
    `the matter or transaction was a subcontract to execute work comprised in such a contract` IS FALSE

`subcontract` MEANS `Government Contract Facts` WITH
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with the Government or any department of the Government` IS FALSE
    `the matter or transaction was a contract or a proposal for a contract with a public body` IS FALSE
    `the matter or transaction was a subcontract to execute work comprised in such a contract` IS TRUE

