#ASSERT `the matter or transaction was a government or public body contract, or a subcontract` `public body contract`

#ASSERT `the matter or transaction was a government or public body contract, or a subcontract` `subcontract`

#ASSERT NOT `the matter or transaction was a government or public body contract, or a subcontract` `no contract`

