`s13 convicted, money` MEANS `Section 13 Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence committed by the acceptance of a gratification in contravention of the Act` IS TRUE
    `the gratification is a sum of money` IS TRUE
    `the value of the gratification can be assessed` IS FALSE
    `the amount of the gratification, or in the court's opinion its value, in dollars` IS 5000
    `the other offences taken into consideration under section 148 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 were offences for the acceptance of gratification in contravention of the Act` IS FALSE
    `the total amount or value of the gratification specified in the charges for the offences taken into consideration, in dollars` IS 0

`s13 convicted, assessable only` MEANS `Section 13 Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence committed by the acceptance of a gratification in contravention of the Act` IS TRUE
    `the gratification is a sum of money` IS FALSE
    `the value of the gratification can be assessed` IS TRUE
    `the amount of the gratification, or in the court's opinion its value, in dollars` IS 12000
    `the other offences taken into consideration under section 148 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 were offences for the acceptance of gratification in contravention of the Act` IS FALSE
    `the total amount or value of the gratification specified in the charges for the offences taken into consideration, in dollars` IS 0

