    `the gratification is a sum of money` IS TRUE
    `the value of the gratification can be assessed` IS FALSE
    `the amount of the gratification, or in the court's opinion its value, in dollars` IS 5000
    `the other offences taken into consideration under section 148 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 were offences for the acceptance of gratification in contravention of the Act` IS FALSE
    `the total amount or value of the gratification specified in the charges for the offences taken into consideration, in dollars` IS 8000

`s13 not convicted, other offences considered` MEANS `Section 13 Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence committed by the acceptance of a gratification in contravention of the Act` IS FALSE
    `the gratification is a sum of money` IS TRUE
    `the value of the gratification can be assessed` IS FALSE
    `the amount of the gratification, or in the court's opinion its value, in dollars` IS 0
    `the other offences taken into consideration under section 148 of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 were offences for the acceptance of gratification in contravention of the Act` IS TRUE
    `the total amount or value of the gratification specified in the charges for the offences taken into consideration, in dollars` IS 8000

#ASSERT `the court must order a penalty under section 13(1)` `s13 convicted, money`

#ASSERT `the court must order a penalty under section 13(1)` `s13 convicted, assessable only`

#ASSERT NOT `the court must order a penalty under section 13(1)` `s13 convicted, neither money nor assessable`

#ASSERT NOT `the court must order a penalty under section 13(1)` `s13 not convicted of acceptance`

#ASSERT `the penalty under section 13(1) in dollars` `s13 convicted, money` EQUALS JUST 5000

#ASSERT `the penalty under section 13(1) in dollars` `s13 convicted, assessable only` EQUALS JUST 12000

#ASSERT `the penalty under section 13(1) in dollars` `s13 convicted, neither money nor assessable` EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `the penalty under section 13(1) in dollars` `s13 not convicted of acceptance` EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `the greatest increase of the penalty the court may make under section 13(2) in dollars` `s13 convicted, money, other offences considered` EQUALS 8000

#ASSERT `the greatest increase of the penalty the court may make under section 13(2) in dollars` `s13 convicted, money, no other offences` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the greatest increase of the penalty the court may make under section 13(2) in dollars` `s13 not convicted, other offences considered` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the greatest increase of the penalty the court may make under section 13(2) in dollars` `s13 convicted, money` EQUALS 0

§ `14. principal may recover the amount of a secret gift`

`s14 principal v agent` MEANS `Section 14 Facts` WITH
    `a gratification has, in contravention of this Act, been given by a person to an agent` IS TRUE
    `the defendant is the agent or the person who gave the gratification` IS TRUE
    `the plaintiff is the principal` IS TRUE

`s14 stranger sues` MEANS `Section 14 Facts` WITH
    `a gratification has, in contravention of this Act, been given by a person to an agent` IS TRUE
    `the defendant is the agent or the person who gave the gratification` IS TRUE
    `the plaintiff is the principal` IS FALSE

`s14 principal sues a stranger` MEANS `Section 14 Facts` WITH
    `a gratification has, in contravention of this Act, been given by a person to an agent` IS TRUE
    `the defendant is the agent or the person who gave the gratification` IS FALSE
    `the plaintiff is the principal` IS TRUE

`s14 no contravening gift` MEANS `Section 14 Facts` WITH
    `a gratification has, in contravention of this Act, been given by a person to an agent` IS FALSE
    `the defendant is the agent or the person who gave the gratification` IS TRUE
    `the plaintiff is the principal` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the principal may recover the amount as a civil debt` `s14 principal v agent`

#ASSERT NOT `the principal may recover the amount as a civil debt` `s14 stranger sues`

#ASSERT NOT `the principal may recover the amount as a civil debt` `s14 principal sues a stranger`

#ASSERT NOT `the principal may recover the amount as a civil debt` `s14 no contravening gift`
